VeridianOS: colors KCM: no leftover debug message(WARNING)

kcms/colors/CMakeLists.txt printed the accent colour D-Bus adaptor's
generated file names as a CMake warning on every configure
("message(WARNING "${plasma-accentcolor-service_DBUS_SRCS}")"), a debug
line left behind (still on upstream master). Removed; nothing else uses
it.

--- a/kcms/colors/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/kcms/colors/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -51,7 +51,6 @@
     org.kde.plasmashell.accentColor.xml
     OPTIONS -M
 )
-message(WARNING "${plasma-accentcolor-service_DBUS_SRCS}")
 target_sources(plasma-apply-colorscheme PRIVATE ${plasma-accentcolor-service_DBUS_SRCS})
 target_sources(plasma-apply-colorscheme PRIVATE 
     plasma-apply-colorscheme.cpp
